        <tbody>{decrease_rows}</tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="chart-container">
        <canvas id="decreaseChart"></canvas>
    </div>

    <div class="insight-box">
        <strong>Success stories:</strong> Countries with the largest reductions often underwent significant
        institutional reforms, post-conflict stabilization, or targeted public safety programs.
        These cases provide evidence that sustained policy interventions can dramatically reduce
        homicide rates over time.
    </div>

